//
// `steady_income`'s box and colony -- 52 ants at column 256, no plants, rain off, 40 cells of provisions 30 columns
// east every 1,000 frames -- **with the income switched off for 15,000 frames in every 35,000: a famine**. The
// trained colony already booms and busts on steady income (step 0: 9 -> 230 -> 80 ants, 2 of 8 seeds extinct by
// 150,000 frames); the famines make that the stake the player's two channels (the food trail, the shared stomach)
// are measured against. The famine length is a first guess to be set by the plan's stake step.
